{"title":"Walking the Earth","link":"https://kottke.org/25/10/walking-the-earth","date":1761223755000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/big-buddha-nara.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/big-buddha-nara.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/big-buddha-nara.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1600\" height=\"2358\" alt=\"the Great Buddha and a group of adorably chapeaued schoolchildren at the Todai-ji Temple in Nara.\" /></p>\n\n<p>Hey folks. I’m going off the grid for a few days. Call it a spiritual retreat of sorts. I’ll be back soon; be well in the meantime.</p>\n\n<p>The image is of the Great Buddha and a group of adorably chapeaued schoolchildren at <a href=\"https://www.todaiji.or.jp/en/information/daibutsuden/\">the Todai-ji Temple</a> in Nara.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/kottke.org\">kottke.org</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/10/walking-the-earth\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"fa39d912cc5d510331c7966bab2354a9e840047dc9a1b952277c7c1d961fb425","category":"Sites"}